Cell["\<\
IMPORTANT NOTE: the code of \
https://github.com/gabriel-andres-piovano/Spinning-Body-Hamilton-Jacobi (see \
the Mathematica notebook \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Corrections_orbits.nb\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]\[CloseCurlyQuote]  within) is in perfect agreement with \
the results of  PRD 108, 044041 \
(https://journals.aps.org/prd/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevD.108.044041 ). \
However, their code is NOT publicly available. Thus, this notebook only \
compare with the results of the Hamilton-Jacobi formalism.\
\>", "Text",
